  "prefLabel": "Ins 4401.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4401.01 Purpose and Scope.\n\n(a) The purpose of this part is to establish criteria for actuarial certification that the insurer is in compliance with RSA 415-H.\n\n(b) This part shall apply to all accident and health insurers licensed to do business in this state.\n\nSource. #9244, eff 9-2-08; ss by #11149, eff 9-2-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4400.html"
}
